      "snippet": {
        "line": 263,
        "text": "theorem Pi_canonical (F : Profile) (XR eta X : ℝ) (hXR : 0 < XR) (hX : 0 < X) : Pi F XR (X, eta) = -(1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∫ u in Ioi X, E F XR (u, eta) ^ 2 / u — the same statement after the substitution u = e^v, i.e. the paper's 'integration of Π_X = E²/(2X) from this datum'"
      }
    }
  }
